   "source": [
    "# FYP Prototype: AI to Detect Emotional Manipulation in Online Messages\n",
    "**CB011219 – Lasith Siriwardena**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook fine-tunes BERT on the `manipulational_conversation.jsonl` dataset to classify online messages as:\n",
    "- `neutral`\n",
    "- `guilt_tripping`\n",
    "- `charm_flattery`\n",
    "- `direct_coercion`\n",
    "- `gaslighting`\n",
    "- `love_bombing`\n",
    "- `passive_aggressive`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1: Install Dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
