   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 2: Upload Your Dataset\n",
    "Run this cell and upload `archive.zip` when prompted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
